---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy policy — PubliTools';
const description = 'Privacy policy of PubliTools and PubliTech OÜ.';
---
<Layout lang="en" title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/privacy-policy/" alternateUrl="https://publitools.ai/fr/confidentialite">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Data protection</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Privacy policy</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Data controller</h2><p class="mt-4">Data collected in connection with the PubliTools website and service is processed by <strong class="text-[#262832]">PubliTech OÜ</strong>, VAT <strong class="text-[#262832]">EE102901191</strong>, registry code <strong class="text-[#262832]">17324362</strong>, with registered office at <strong class="text-[#262832]">Harju maakond, Tallinn, Kesklinna linnaosa, Tornimäe tn 5, 10145</strong>.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Data concerned</h2><p class="mt-4">Data that may be collected includes identification, contact, browsing, login and service usage data, as well as information necessary for the operation of the proposed features and for user support.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Purposes</h2><p class="mt-4">Data may be used to manage accounts, provide services, perform subscribed features, respond to contact requests, improve the product, prevent abusive use and manage the business relationship.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Legal basis</h2><p class="mt-4">Processing is carried out according to applicable legal bases, including performance of the contractual relationship, the publisher's legitimate interest, compliance with legal obligations, or consent where required.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Retention</h2><p class="mt-4">Data is retained for a period proportionate to the purposes pursued, contractual obligations, security constraints and applicable legal obligations.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. Recipients</h2><p class="mt-4">Data may be accessible to internal teams, technical service providers and, where applicable, partners strictly necessary for the operation of the service, within the limits of what is required for their mission.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. User rights</h2><p class="mt-4">Users may request information about their data, its rectification, deletion, limitation, or exercise any other right provided by applicable regulations, under the conditions set by those regulations.</p></section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>